      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mimi seems interested in your Diancite...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069006D00690020007300650065006D007300200069006E0074006500720065007300740065006400200069006E00200079006F007500720020004400690061006E0063006900740065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Murrr-mrrrawr?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075007200720072002D006D007200720072006100770072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrawp!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200610077007000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mimi must be sensing some kind of psychic\nenergy.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069006D00690020006D007500730074002000620065002000730065006E00730069006E006700200073006F006D00650020006B0069006E00640020006F006600200070007300790063006800690063000A0065006E0065007200670079002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It can telepathically pick up thoughts and feelings\nand transmit them to another person.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Using telepathy takes a lot out of Mimi, so I’ve\nasked it to hold back.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut even so, sometimes it happens to pick up on\nsomething—like just now.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wonder what it’s detecting.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMaybe that Diancite you’ve got is imbued with\nsome kind of strong emotion?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why don’t we follow Mimi and see where it’s\nheaded, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068007900200064006F006E2019007400200077006500200066006F006C006C006F00770020004D0069006D006900200061006E0064002000730065006500200077006800650072006500200069007420190073000A006800650061006400650064002C00200010000201000000003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think Mimi’s picking up on something.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007400680069006E006B0020004D0069006D0069201900730020007000690063006B0069006E00670020007500700020006F006E00200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold on a sec.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C00640020006F006E002000610020007300650063002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hi, Sedna?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480069002C0020005300650064006E0061003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mimi and I are on a case right now, and we might\nneed your help.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069006D006900200061006E00640020004900200061007200650020006F006E00200061002000630061007300650020007200690067006800740020006E006F0077002C00200061006E00640020007700650020006D0069006700680074000A006E00650065006400200079006F00750072002000680065006C0070002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, if you could let Eris and Nix know too, that\nwould be great.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C00200069006600200079006F007500200063006F0075006C00640020006C006500740020004500720069007300200061006E00640020004E006900780020006B006E006F007700200074006F006F002C00200074006800610074000A0077006F0075006C0064002000620065002000670072006500610074002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry about that. I was just checking in with\nsome friends from back in the day.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Back in the day?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200610063006B00200069006E00200074006800650020006400610079003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Old friends, huh?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006C006400200066007200690065006E00640073002C0020006800750068003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah. You see, I run the bureau now, but it was\nstarted by a detective named Looker.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is that why it’s called the Looker Bureau?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007300200074006800610074002000770068007900200069007420190073002000630061006C006C0065006400200074006800650020004C006F006F006B006500720020004200750072006500610075003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, is that who your office is named after?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200069007300200074006800610074002000770068006F00200079006F007500720020006F006600660069006300650020006900730020006E0061006D00650064002000610066007400650072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Exactly! He was such a kind person and helped\nteach me so much...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450078006100630074006C00790021002000480065002000770061007300200073007500630068002000610020006B0069006E006400200070006500720073006F006E00200061006E0064002000680065006C007000650064000A007400650061006300680020006D006500200073006F0020006D007500630068002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But it turned out he wasn’t any ordinary private\ndetective—he was an International Police officer!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo eventually, he had to go off and solve more\ncases somewhere else—far away, probably.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 194
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I took over for him as head of the bureau, and I’m\ndoing my best to run things with the help of Mimi<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand those friends I just spoke to.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mimi has been particularly helpful. Its telepathy\nhas helped solve so many cases!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But like I said, it gets worn out if it uses those\npowers too much.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020006C0069006B00650020004900200073006100690064002C0020006900740020006700650074007300200077006F0072006E0020006F0075007400200069006600200069007400200075007300650073002000740068006F00730065000A0070006F007700650072007300200074006F006F0020006D007500630068002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Murrr-mrrrawr?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075007200720072002D006D007200720072006100770072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrawp!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200610077007000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Come on, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. Let’s follow\nMimi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000043006F006D00650020006F006E002C00200010000201000000002E0020004C006500742019007300200066006F006C006C006F0077000A004D0069006D0069002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What is it, Mimi? Wait—were you picking up on\nmy own feelings?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000690073002000690074002C0020004D0069006D0069003F002000570061006900742014007700650072006500200079006F00750020007000690063006B0069006E00670020007500700020006F006E000A006D00790020006F0077006E0020006600650065006C0069006E00670073003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is this Mimi’s mystical power?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490073002000740068006900730020004D0069006D0069201900730020006D007900730074006900630061006C00200070006F007700650072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Somehow you can hear Emma’s thoughts in\nyour head...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n... ... ...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“What’s going on with Mimi? Is it hungry? I’m\ngetting pretty hungry myself...”<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n... ... ...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 165
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you all right, Emma?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F007500200061006C006C002000720069006700680074002C00200045006D006D0061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you hungry?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F0075002000680075006E006700720079003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, yes! I was just thinking I could go for a little\nbite to eat.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000790065007300210020004900200077006100730020006A0075007300740020007400680069006E006B0069006E00670020004900200063006F0075006C006400200067006F00200066006F0072002000610020006C006900740074006C0065000A006200690074006500200074006F0020006500610074002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrrrawr.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200720072006100770072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for looking out for me, Mimi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B007300200066006F00720020006C006F006F006B0069006E00670020006F0075007400200066006F00720020006D0065002C0020004D0069006D0069002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What do you say we make a little pit stop to\nrefuel?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F007500200073006100790020007700650020006D0061006B0065002000610020006C006900740074006C00650020007000690074002000730074006F007000200074006F000A00720065006600750065006C003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That was delicious, wasn’t it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100740020007700610073002000640065006C006900630069006F00750073002C0020007700610073006E20190074002000690074003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now then, Mimi, how about you show us where\nyou wanted to go?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00770020007400680065006E002C0020004D0069006D0069002C00200068006F0077002000610062006F0075007400200079006F0075002000730068006F0077002000750073002000770068006500720065000A0079006F0075002000770061006E00740065006400200074006F00200067006F003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Murrr-mrrrawr?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075007200720072002D006D007200720072006100770072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrawp!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200610077007000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Come on, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. Let’s follow!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000043006F006D00650020006F006E002C00200010000201000000002E0020004C006500742019007300200066006F006C006C006F0077002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’s up, Mimi? What’re you doing in front of\nthat Holovator?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007420190073002000750070002C0020004D0069006D0069003F0020005700680061007420190072006500200079006F007500200064006F0069006E006700200069006E002000660072006F006E00740020006F0066000A007400680061007400200048006F006C006F007600610074006F0072003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrrrawwwrar...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0072007200720061007700770077007200610072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrawp!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200610077007000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You want to go up, don’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000770061006E007400200074006F00200067006F002000750070002C00200064006F006E2019007400200079006F0075003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrawr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200610077007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think we’re close to finally unraveling the truth.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 5740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007400680069006E006B00200077006520190072006500200063006C006F0073006500200074006F002000660069006E0061006C006C007900200075006E0072006100760065006C0069006E00670020007400680065002000740072007500740068002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>We’ll go first. See you up there,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 5856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000005700652019006C006C00200067006F002000660069007200730074002E002000530065006500200079006F0075002000750070002000740068006500720065002C000A0010000201000000002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 5952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whatever you were sensing is around here, right,\nMimi?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 5964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074006500760065007200200079006F007500200077006500720065002000730065006E00730069006E0067002000690073002000610072006F0075006E006400200068006500720065002C002000720069006700680074002C000A004D0069006D0069003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrawr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200610077007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There are so many Mega Crystals here... Too\nmany. It’s not normal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500720065002000610072006500200073006F0020006D0061006E00790020004D0065006700610020004300720079007300740061006C007300200068006500720065002E002E002E00200054006F006F000A006D0061006E0079002E002000490074201900730020006E006F00740020006E006F0072006D0061006C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrrr-mrrrawwwrrr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 6244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200720072002D006D007200720072006100770077007700720072007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Carbink...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 6280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061007200620069006E006B002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And what’s that other Pokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 6312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640020007700680061007420190073002000740068006100740020006F007400680065007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe it’s related to your Mega Stone somehow?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 6384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100790062006500200069007420190073002000720065006C006100740065006400200074006F00200079006F007500720020004D006500670061002000530074006F006E006500200073006F006D00650068006F0077003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrawr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 6488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200610077007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The only way to find out whether it’s connected\nto your Mega Stone is to catch it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 6504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrrraaawwwr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 6680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200720072006100610061007700770077007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 6708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Diiiaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 6720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400690069006900610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 6740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You need to catch it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 6752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006E00650065006400200074006F002000630061007400630068002000690074002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t defeat it—you need to catch it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 6804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E20190074002000640065006600650061007400200069007420140079006F00750020006E00650065006400200074006F002000630061007400630068002000690074002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Good job! I knew you could handle it,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 6888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000047006F006F00640020006A006F00620021002000490020006B006E0065007700200079006F007500200063006F0075006C0064002000680061006E0064006C0065002000690074002C000A0010000201000000002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, can I see that Pokémon you just caught?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 6992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C002000630061006E0020004900200073006500650020007400680061007400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200079006F00750020006A0075007300740020006300610075006700680074003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s so pretty...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 7092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200073006F0020007000720065007400740079002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Its glimmer reminds me of the Anistar Sundial.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 7136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074007300200067006C0069006D006D00650072002000720065006D0069006E006400730020006D00650020006F0066002000740068006500200041006E00690073007400610072002000530075006E006400690061006C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anistar?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 7240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00690073007400610072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sundial?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 7260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075006E006400690061006C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, there’s a strange sundial in Anistar City\nsaid to have something to do with Mega Stones.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 7280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This brings so many things to mind...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 7480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006900730020006200720069006E0067007300200073006F0020006D0061006E00790020007400680069006E0067007300200074006F0020006D0069006E0064002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In particular, I’m thinking about two people I’ve\nmet since I parted ways with Looker.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 7564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Namely, AZ and Professor Sycamore.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 7748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0061006D0065006C0079002C00200041005A00200061006E0064002000500072006F0066006500730073006F007200200053007900630061006D006F00720065002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The professor spoke with AZ as part of his\nresearch into Mega Evolution.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 7828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Professor Sycamore’s theory was that Mega\nStones formed three thousand years ago...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nwhen certain stones were irradiated by the light—\nthe energy of the Legendary Pokémon—that was<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfired from the ultimate weapon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 7984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 221
    },
    {
      "displayText": "AZ nodded when he heard that.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAccording to him, that’s why we’ve been finding\nnew types of Mega Stones recently.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 8428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "After all, the ultimate weapon was fired again five\nyears ago...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 8668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006600740065007200200061006C006C002C002000740068006500200075006C00740069006D00610074006500200077006500610070006F006E002000770061007300200066006900720065006400200061006700610069006E00200066006900760065000A00790065006100720073002000610067006F002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrrrawrrr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 8808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00720072007200610077007200720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s OK, Mimi. I’m here to keep Lumiose safe. And\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> is here to help, too!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 8836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Make sure you take good care of this Pokémon,\nOK, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 9000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006B00650020007300750072006500200079006F0075002000740061006B006500200067006F006F0064002000630061007200650020006F00660020007400680069007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C000A004F004B002C00200010000201000000003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lumiose needs people like you. People who can\nreally bond with all sorts of Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 9120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess we’ll head back to the Looker Bureau.\nTake care!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 9300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006700750065007300730020007700652019006C006C002000680065006100640020006200610063006B00200074006F00200074006800650020004C006F006F006B006500720020004200750072006500610075002E000A00540061006B006500200063006100720065002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah! I just remembered that AZ mentioned\nsomething else.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 9424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680021002000490020006A007500730074002000720065006D0065006D006200650072006500640020007400680061007400200041005A0020006D0065006E00740069006F006E00650064000A0073006F006D0065007400680069006E006700200065006C00730065002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He said during his long journey searching for\nFloette, he saw a phenomenon in Hoenn that may<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhave been the beginning of all Mega Evolution!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 9544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s what got him always thinking about the\nbonds between people and Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 9840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Anyway, thanks for helping us out,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI’ll<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsee<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naround!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 17,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 10008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    }
  ],
